# Areas of the repository, read by .github/changes.sh: "area glob", one pattern per line. A pull
# request runs the jobs of the areas it touches (ci.yml); a change under .github/ selects them all,
# and so does a push to main, since a release is built from everything.
rust src/*
rust Cargo.toml
rust Cargo.lock
rust deny.toml
nix flake.nix
nix flake.lock
nix nix/*
nix Cargo.toml
nix Cargo.lock
nix sunrise-brightness.svg
